  - Instantiates a persistent, shared `socket.io-client` connection.
  - Automatically reconnects if network drops, falling back from WebSocket to HTTP long-polling if necessary.
- **Why required by system:**
  - Prevents opening duplicate socket connections each time a component mounts or unmounts.
